  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian government is currently addressing an investigation into the alleged illegal wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto. As authorities work to uncover the origins and scope of the surveillance, legislative members have expressed support for the national police to conduct a thorough inquiry. Public figures and legal analysts have raised concerns regarding the severity of the incident, with some suggesting that such actions could meet the criteria for treason, a charge that carries significant legal penalties. In response to the developments, President Prabowo held a consultation with ten former heads of the national police force at his Hambalang estate. Simultaneously, the Witness and Victim Protection Agency has been approached to evaluate protection requests for six key witnesses to ensure their safety as the investigation proceeds. Authorities maintain that no individual or group is exempt from legal accountability regarding this security breach.",
